      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَقَّابَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A low,</i> or <i>an ignoble, man, a servant,</i> or <i>a
slave,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ وَغْدٌ</span>, (S, K,) <i>who keeps, guards,</i>
or <i>watches, the</i> [<i>utensils and furniture called</i>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْل</span> <i>of a people when they are absent.</i> (S.)

